<title>CHINA: China's northeastern zinc plant export at $31 mln.</title>
<headline>China's northeastern zinc plant export at $31 mln.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's northeastern Liaoning Huluodao zinc plant exported 27,000 tonnes of zinc in the first two months of this year worth $31 million, the Chemical Industrial News said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The plant's total industrial output in the first two months were 364.88 million yuan, up by 28.7 percent compared with the year-ago period, the newspaper said.</p>
<p>It gave no further details.</p>
<p>-- Beijing Newsroom (8610) 6532 1921</p>
